<title>MEXICO: Carso Q1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Carso Q1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997		  Q1 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  0.93		     1.53</p>
<p>     Net		  854.23 million	 1.398 bln</p>
<p>     Revs		 6.480 bln		6.451 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     2.121 bln		2.235 bln</p>
<p>     Oper profit	1.237 bln		1.418 bln</p>
<p>     Integ fin cost   53.957 million     gain  8.097 million</p>
<p>	    Int paid    700.52 million	     848.34 million</p>
<p>	    FX gain     38.73 million	gain  251.13 million</p>
<p>	    Int earned  78.80 million		140.39 million</p>
<p>	    Mon gain    529.03 million     gain  464.92 million</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Grupo Carso SA.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
